{%- comment -%}
  exp-custom-icons.liquid
  Renders a payment icon SVG by name.
  Width/height are intentionally omitted from SVG attributes — controlled by CSS via --icon-width.
  All SVGs share viewBox="0 0 38 24" for consistent aspect ratio.

  @param {string} icon - Icon name (already stripped and downcased by caller)
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- case icon -%}

